    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n58230" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κνυζ-όω</span></b> , (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κνυζός</span>)
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>make dim</i> or
			<i>dark</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κνυζώσω δέ τοι ὄσσε πάρος περικαλλέ᾽
					ἐόντε</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					13.401
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				433
			</span></i>. (Perh. connected with 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κνύζα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.
				</span></i>
			) </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			
				Dor.
			, 
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ξύω</span>
			, <i>scratch,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				EM
				522.54
			</span></i>, prob. in <i><span class="en">
				Sophr.
				53
			</span></i> (
				Pass.
			).</div>
